    "Aug. Field Analysis effectiveness mult:": "义体现场分析效率倍率：",
    "Performing actions will use up your stamina.": "执行行动会消耗体力。",
    "Your max stamina is determined primarily by your agility stat.": "体力上限主要由你的敏捷属性决定。",
    "Your stamina gain rate is determined by both your agility and your max stamina. Higher max stamina leads to a higher gain rate.": "体力恢复速度取决于你的敏捷与体力上限。体力上限越高，恢复越快。",
    "Once your stamina falls below 50% of its max value, it begins to negatively affect the success rate of your contracts/operations. This penalty is shown in the overview panel. If the penalty is 15%, then this means your success rate would be multiplied by 85% (100 - 15).": "体力一旦低于上限的 50%，就会开始负面影响契约/行动的成功率。该惩罚显示在概览面板中。若惩罚为 15%，意味着你的成功率要乘以 85%（100 - 15）。",
    "Your max stamina and stamina gain rate can also be increased by training, or through skills and Augmentation upgrades.": "训练、技能与义体升级同样能提升体力上限与恢复速度。",
    "This is your Bladeburner division's estimate of how many Synthoids exist in your current city. An accurate population estimate increases success rate estimates.": "这是你的刃行者部门对当前城市中仿生人数量的估计。估计越准确，成功率估算就越可靠。",
    "You should be careful with actions that decrease Synthoid population by percentage. Those actions can kill a large number of Synthoids in a short amount of time. Low population count decreases the success chance of most actions. If the population count is too low, you will need to move to another city.": "你应当谨慎使用按百分比减少仿生人数量的行动。这类行动会在短时间内杀死大量仿生人。人口偏低会降低多数行动的成功率。若数量过低，你就需要转往其他城市。",
    "This is your Bladeburner division's estimate of how many Synthoid communities exist in your current city.": "这是你的刃行者部门对当前城市中仿生人社区数量的估计。",
    "Tensions and conflicts between humans and Synthoids increase the city's chaos level. High chaos level makes contracts and operations harder.": "人类与仿生人之间的紧张与冲突会推高城市混乱等级。混乱等级越高，契约与行动越难。",
    "You gain bonus time while offline or when the game is inactive (e.g. when the tab is throttled by browser). Bonus time makes the Bladeburner mechanic progress faster, up to 5x the normal speed.": "离线或游戏处于非活动状态（例如标签页被浏览器降速）时你会获得额外时间。额外时间会让刃行者机制以最高 5 倍于正常的速度推进。",
