    "Stop your current action and go idle.": "停止当前行动并进入空闲状态。",
    "Level or display information about your skills.": "升级或显示你的技能信息。",
    "[general, contracts, ops, blackops, events]": "[general（常规）、contracts（契约）、ops（行动）、blackops（黑色行动）、events（事件）]",
    "[general, contract, op, blackop]": "[general、contract、op、blackop]",
